description:
Write `std::vector<std::string> searchedFolders(unsigned flags, const std::string& appDir, const std::string& dllDir, const std::vector<std::string>& userDirs)` returning the folders `LoadLibraryExW` searches for a DLL's dependencies, in this order:

1. `dllDir` if `LOAD_LIBRARY_SEARCH_DLL_LOAD_DIR` (0x100) is set;
2. `appDir` if `LOAD_LIBRARY_SEARCH_APPLICATION_DIR` (0x200) is set;
3. each of `userDirs` if `LOAD_LIBRARY_SEARCH_USER_DIRS` (0x400) is set;
4. `"C:\\Windows\\System32"` if `LOAD_LIBRARY_SEARCH_SYSTEM32` (0x800) is set.

`LOAD_LIBRARY_SEARCH_DEFAULT_DIRS` (0x1000) means application folder, user folders and System32 together.

